@startuml admin_create_question_flow
title Sequence Diagram - Teacher Create Question

actor Teacher
boundary "CreateQuestionPage" as UI <<boundary>>
control QuestionController
control QuestionRequest
control QuestionService
control QuestionRepository
database DB

' ===== Flow bắt đầu =====
Teacher -> UI: Gửi request tạo câu hỏi
UI -> QuestionController: Gửi request tạo câu hỏi

QuestionController -> QuestionRequest: Validate dữ liệu

alt Dữ liệu không hợp lệ
    QuestionRequest --> QuestionController: Error
    QuestionController --> Teacher: Thông báo lỗi
else Hợp lệ
    QuestionController -> QuestionService: Create question
    QuestionService -> QuestionRepository: Insert question
    QuestionRepository -> DB: INSERT question
    DB --> QuestionRepository: OK
    QuestionRepository --> QuestionService: Question created
    QuestionService --> QuestionController: Success
    QuestionController --> UI: Tạo thành công
end

@enduml